    <h1>Configure a survey</h1>
    <p>Use SPP Self Service to migrate, configure, and manage surveys.</p>

    <h2>Choose survey to set up</h2>
    <p>The table contains all ONS surveys that are available to be configured on SPP.</p>
    <p>Using SPP Self Service you can:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Add or update survey form types</li>
        <li>Add or update validation rules</li>
        <li>Create a new release of a survey to deploy to SPP environments</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Click on the survey name to access its configuration.</p>

